Ported code
-----------

The AirPlay engine (src/AirPlay.Engine) is a C# port of parts of OwnTone
(https://github.com/owntone/owntone-server, commit e2a3915):

- src/outputs/airplay.c, src/outputs/rtp_common.c, src/outputs/airplay_events.c
  Copyright (C) 2019- Espen Jürgensen and the OwnTone authors.
  GNU General Public License, version 2 or later.

- src/pair_ap/pair_homekit.c (HomeKit pairing), itself adapted from
  ap2-sender by ViktoriiaKh (https://github.com/ViktoriiaKh/ap2-sender),
  csrp by Tom Cocagne (https://github.com/cocagne/csrp) and
  esp-homekit by Maxim Kulkin (https://github.com/maximkulkin/esp-homekit).
  MIT License (text below).

- src/libairptp (the PTP clock master).
  Copyright (c) 2026 OwnTone. MIT License (text below).

The AirPlay receiver (src/AirPlay.Engine/Receiver) follows Shairport Sync
(https://github.com/mikebrady/shairport-sync): its announced values and
replies (rtsp.c, bonjour_strings.c), the buffered audio format (player.c),
and the FairPlay setup replies, which are copied from rtsp.c.
  Copyright (c) 2011-2014 James Laird, 2014- Mike Brady and the Shairport Sync
  contributors. MIT License (text below).


